erformed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3175248963","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/109426#issuecomment-3175248963","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/109426","id":3175248963,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc69QnRD","user":{"login":"KoBeWi","id":2223172,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjIyMjMxNzI=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/2223172?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi","html_url":"https://github.com/KoBeWi","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-08-11T14:58:21Z","updated_at":"2025-08-11T15:07:55Z","body":"~~I think the error may only happen after doc cache is invalidated, which happens once per version. Thus it's easier to test in custom builds, where each commit is treated as separate version. It's still not reliable to reproduce though.~~\n\nEDIT:\nNevermind, the script cache has a separate file, which is not versioned. `editor_script_doc_cache.res` in `.godot/editor`.","author_association":"MEMBER","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3175248963/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3175878104","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/109426#issuecomment-3175878104","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/109426","id":3175878104,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc69TA3Y","user":{"login":"mihe","id":4884246,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ4ODQyNDY=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/4884246?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/mihe","html_url":"https://github.com/mihe","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mihe/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mihe/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mihe/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mihe/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mihe/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mihe/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mihe/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mihe/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mihe/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-08-11T16:50:35Z","updated_at":"2025-08-11T16:52:10Z","body":"So for whatever reason I currently have a 100% repro for this, in a large real-world project, but only on macOS for some reason, using c81fd6c51233a727da528cf7f74137d56b5d6efe.\n\nThis particular repro manifests itself in the same way as what you reported @KoBeWi, where it emits every time you save the file, but only if the contents have changed as well.\n\nWhen looking at the flow of things in this repro there's definitely something wrong here, but I'm not totally sure yet why it's not just breaking for everyone all the time.\n\nHere's what seems to happen:\n\n1. `EditorNode::_notification` calls `EditorHelp::generate_doc()` in its `NOTIFICATION_POSTINITIALIZE`.\n2. We have an existing `editor_doc_cache-*.res`, so `EditorHelp` tries to start `_load_doc_thread`.\n3. That particular cache is valid, so we defer a call to `EditorHelp::load_script_doc_cache`.\n4. `EditorHelp::load_script_doc_cache` finds that we do *not* have an `editor_script_doc_cache.res` for whatever reason, so we call `EditorHelp::regenerate_script_doc_cache` and do an early-out.\n5. `regenerate_script_doc_cache` finds that `EditorFileSystem` is still scanning, so we defer another call to `regenerate_script_doc_cache` by connecting it onto the `EditorFileSystem::sources_changed` signal.\n6. The `EditorFileSystem::sources_changed` signal is seemingly *always* emitted from [here](https://github.com/godotengine/godot/blob/ca452113d430cb96de409a297ff5b52389f1c9d9/editor/file_system/editor_file_system.cpp#L1775), where `EditorFileSystem::is_scanning()` will *always* be `true`, due to `scanning_changes` always being `true`, leading `EditorHelp::regenerate_script_doc_cache` to get stuck in an infinite \"loop\".\n7. Since `_load_script_doc_cache_thread` is never run, we never (?) set the `EditorHelp::_script_docs_loaded` flag.\n\nAgain, I haven't compared this with my Linux machine to see wherein the discrepancy lies, but I'm assuming for now that it has something to do with differences in when/how `EditorFileSystem` scanning happens.","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3175878104/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3175943319","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/109426#issuecomment-3175943319","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/109426","id":3175943319,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc69TQyX","user":{"login":"KoBeWi","id":2223172,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjIyMjMxNzI=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/2223172?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi","html_url":"https://github.com/KoBeWi","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-08-11T17:01:18Z","updated_at":"2025-08-11T17:06:20Z","body":"> EditorHelp::load_script_doc_cache finds that we do not have an editor_script_doc_cache.res for whatever reason, so we call EditorHelp::regenerate_script_doc_cache and do an early-out.\n\nMaybe it's because script cache, for whatever reason, is a Resource, and that method uses `ResourceLoader::exists()` to check it? It would be nice if simply moving it to a regular file would fix it.\n\nEDIT:\nLooks like the reason for using Resource is that it can be compressed (easily).","author_association":"MEMBER","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3175943319/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3175966878","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/109426#issuecomment-3175966878","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/109426","id":3175966878,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc69TWie","user":{"login":"mihe","id":4884246,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ4ODQyNDY=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/4884246?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/mihe","html_url":"https://github.com/mihe","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mihe/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mihe/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mihe/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mihe/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mihe/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mihe/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mihe/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mihe/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mihe/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-08-11T17:09:10Z","updated_at":"2025-08-11T17:11:50Z","body":"> `EditorHelp::load_script_doc_cache` finds that we do _not_ have an `editor_script_doc_cache.res` for whatever reason\n\nMy flippant \"for whatever reason\" above was not entirely justified, as the file simply isn't there, because I had deleted the entire `.godot` folder just prior to this (I realize now).\n\nPerhaps the repro is as simple as just deleting that project cache, while leaving the editor's own cache (the one in `EditorPaths::get_cache_dir()`) intact?\n\nEDIT: It is not, sadly.","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3175966878/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3175977246","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/109426#issuecomment-3175977246","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/109426","id":3175977246,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc69TZEe","user":{"login":"KoBeWi","id":2223172,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjIyMjMxNzI=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/2223172?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi","html_url":"https://github.com/KoBeWi","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-08-11T17:12:16Z","updated_at":"2025-08-11T17:12:16Z","body":"Well, I finished reworking it, will open PR soon. Though it will be difficult to test I guess.","author_association":"MEMBER","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3175977246/reactions","total_count":1,"+1":1,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3175986164","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/109426#issuecomment-3175986164","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/109426","id":3175986164,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc69TbP0","user":{"login":"mihe","id":4884246,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ4ODQyNDY=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/4884246?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/mihe","html_url":"https://github.com/mihe","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mihe/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mihe/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mihe/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mihe/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mihe/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mihe/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mihe/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mihe/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mihe/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-08-11T17:15:14Z","updated_at":"2025-08-11T17:15:14Z","body":"Well I still have 100% repro on my macOS machine. It's no problem for me to test it. The only question is if my particular repro is truly representative.\n\nI also just rebased on latest (ca452113d430cb96de409a297ff5b52389f1c9d9) to make sure it wasn't   because I was previously based on c81fd6c51233a727da528cf7f74137d56b5d6efe, and I can confirm that it still happens.","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3175986164/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3176009017","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/109426#issuecomment-3176009017","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/109426","id":3176009017,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc69Tg05","user":{"login":"mihe","id":4884246,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ4ODQyNDY=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/4884246?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/mihe","html_url":"https://github.com/mihe","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mihe/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mihe/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mihe/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mihe/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mihe/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mihe/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mihe/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mihe/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mihe/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-08-11T17:23:40Z","updated_at":"2025-08-11T17:23:40Z","body":"> Again, I haven't compared this with my Linux machine to see wherein the discrepancy lies, but I'm assuming for now that it has something to do with differences in when/how `EditorFileSystem` scanning happens.\n\nIt seems this was somewhat true at least. On my Linux machine the `EditorFileSystem::sources_changed` signal is emitted [here](https://github.com/godotengine/godot/blob/ca452113d430cb96de409a297ff5b52389f1c9d9/editor/file_system/editor_file_system.cpp#L1796) instead of [here](https://github.com/godotengine/godot/blob/ca452113d430cb96de409a297ff5b52389f1c9d9/editor/file_system/editor_file_system.cpp#L1775), where we're no longer scanning, thus no infinite \"loop\".","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3176009017/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3176010321","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/109426#issuecomment-3176010321","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/109426","id":3176010321,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc69ThJR","user":{"login":"KoBeWi","id":2223172,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjIyMjMxNzI=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/2223172?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi","html_url":"https://github.com/KoBeWi","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-08-11T17:23:55Z","updated_at":"2025-08-11T17:23:55Z","body":"See if #109529 fixes it. May require a couple editor restarts.","author_association":"MEMBER","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3176010321/reactions","total_count":1,"+1":1,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3176149805","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/109426#issuecomment-3176149805","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/109426","id":3176149805,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc69UDMt","user":{"login":"mihe","id":4884246,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ4ODQyNDY=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/4884246?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/mihe","html_url":"https://github.com/mihe","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mihe/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mihe/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mihe/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mihe/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mihe/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mihe/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mihe/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mihe/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mihe/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-08-11T17:54:48Z","updated_at":"2025-08-11T17:54:48Z","body":"> See if [#109529](https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/109529) fixes it. May require a couple editor restarts.\n\nUnfortunately I don't think that fixed it after all, assuming my repro of deleting the project's doc cache (which does seem to work on macOS with this project) isn't too contrived.\n\nThe fundamental problem still seems to be fact that `EditorHelp::regenerate_script_doc_cache` checks against `EditorFileSystem::scanning_changes` from within the signal emission of `EditorFileSystem::sources_changed`, which can potentially be emitted from a place where `EditorFileSystem::scanning_changes` will always be true.\n\nI assume whatever fix we come up with has to resolve that part somehow.\n\nSadly moving the setting of `scanning_changes` to be above the signal emission seems to be out of the question, if I'm reading this comment correctly:\n\nhttps://github.com/godotengine/godot/blob/ca452113d430cb96de409a297ff5b52389f1c9d9/editor/file_system/editor_file_system.cpp#L1775-L1776","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3176149805/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3179019434","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/109426#issuecomment-3179019434","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/109426","id":3179019434,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc69e_yq","user":{"login":"mihe","id":4884246,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ4ODQyNDY=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/4884246?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/mihe","html_url":"https://github.com/mihe","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mihe/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mihe/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mihe/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mihe/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mihe/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mihe/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mihe/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mihe/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mihe/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-08-12T11:58:55Z","updated_at":"2025-08-12T12:01:34Z","body":"> Sadly moving the setting of `scanning_changes` to be above the signal emission seems to be out of the question, if I'm reading this comment correctly\n\nI decided to dig into why that comment was there, and I'm not completely convinced that the PR that added it (#73214) strictly meant for it to be set after the signal is emitted.\n\nSo I went ahead and moved the setting of `scanning_changes` to be before the signal emission. I then tried reproducing the original issue that #73214 was meant to address (on Windows) and I was seemingly unable to, which might indicate that the change to `scanning_changes` wouldn't cause a regression with regards to the original issue at least.\n\nHowever, while that change unsurprisingly fixed the \"loop\" that `EditorHelp::regenerate_script_doc_cache` found itself stuck in, and made it so that `editor_script_doc_cache.res` could be generated and all that, I did in fact still get the \"Can't update documentation\" error exactly **once** and then never again. Re-saving the GDScript file (with changed contents) did not force the error again, like it did before.\n\nSo it would seem that there might be multiple manifestations of this bug, one caused by this issue with `scanning_changes` and the other being something else.","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3179019434/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3179039433","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/109426#issuecomment-3179039433","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/109426","id":3179039433,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc69fErJ","user":{"login":"Lippanon","id":115422160,"node_id":"U_kgDOBuEz0A","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/115422160?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Lippanon","html_url":"https://github.com/Lippanon","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Lippanon/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Lippanon/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Lippanon/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Lippanon/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Lippanon/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Lippanon/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Lippanon/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Lippanon/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Lippanon/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-08-12T12:05:12Z","updated_at":"2025-08-12T12:05:12Z","body":"Also happens on Windows. I can reproduce it somewhat consistently on a big project when inside an autoload script, by removing an indent with shift+tab, saving it, adding the indent, saving it, repeat. I tried doing this in a MRP but wasn't able to produce it there.","author_association":"NONE","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3179039433/reactions","total_count":1,"+1":1,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3197089653","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/109426#issuecomment-3197089653","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/109426","id":3197089653,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6-j7d1","user":{"login":"mihe","id":4884246,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ4ODQyNDY=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/4884246?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/mihe","html_url":"https://github.com/mihe","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mihe/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mihe/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mihe/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mihe/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mihe/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mihe/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mihe/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mihe/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mihe/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-08-18T14:06:37Z","updated_at":"2025-08-18T14:07:34Z","body":"I've opened another pull request that might fix this: #109735\n\nThe case where you see the error every time you save a file (with actual changes) should be fixed, with the `scanning_changes` thing mentioned above, but the case where it's just a one-off occurrence might not be.\n\nIf anyone here can reliably reproduce the random one-off occurences of this error then please try that pull request out and see if it fixes it, or if you start getting a new error about `!doc->class_list.has(edited_class)` instead.\n\nI believe you should be able try it out using the editor builds produced by the CI jobs spawned by that PR:\n\n- Windows: [windows-editor.zip](https://github.com/godotengine/godot/actions/runs/17041451473/artifacts/3789106957)\n- Linux: [linux-editor-mono.zip](https://github.com/godotengine/godot/actions/runs/17041451473/artifacts/3789013990)\n- macOS: [macos-editor.zip](https://github.com/godotengine/godot/actions/runs/17041451473/artifacts/3788667172)","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3197089653/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null}]